{"seq":2,"slug":"related-click-attribution","title":"引导点击与转化归因","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/related-search-query-recommendation/placement-effect/related-click-attribution","wordCount":3536,"readingTime":15,"html":"<h1 id=\"引导点击与转化归因\">引导点击与转化归因</h1><p>用户在 <code>bluetooth earbuds</code> 的结果页点了引导词 <code>earbuds with anc</code>，接着搜、看、下单。这笔订单该不该算给这次引导？直觉上「应该算」——没有那次引导他就不会搜这个词。但这个直觉经不起推敲：用户很可能本来就会在下一步自己搜 <code>anc earbuds</code> 或 <code>noise cancelling earbuds</code>，引导只是<strong>把一次必然发生的搜索提前了几秒</strong>，并没有改变结果。归因问题在这里变得实质化，而它的答案直接决定了相关搜索这个项目的价值评估——如果所有转化都被记成引导的功劳，团队会得到一个虚高的收益数字，然后基于它做错误的产品决策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三种归因口径及其含义\">核心概念：三种归因口径及其含义</h2><p>同一个引导行为，可以被归因到三种不同的口径上，它们回答不同的问题。</p>\n<p><strong>曝光归因</strong>：只要推荐位被展示过，这次会话内发生的转化就算给它一部分功劳。它回答「推荐位覆盖了多少流量」，但严重高估——因为曝光几乎总是发生（只要用户滚到底部），它接近于「把所有转化都算给推荐位」。</p>\n<p><strong>点击归因</strong>：用户点击了引导词之后的转化算给它。这比曝光归因严格得多，但仍然包含大量「用户本来就会做」的情况。它是<strong>大多数团队实际使用的口径</strong>，也是这一篇要重点说清其局限的口径。</p>\n<p><strong>增量归因</strong>：引导<strong>造成</strong>了多少额外的转化（相对没有引导的反事实）。这是唯一对应「相关搜索带来了多少价值」的口径，也是最难测的口径，因为它需要一个反事实。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>口径</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>度量方式</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>高估程度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>曝光归因</td>\n<td>曝过即算</td>\n<td>无需埋点细化</td>\n<td>覆盖面</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>点击归因</td>\n<td>点过才算</td>\n<td>入口标记 + 会话串联</td>\n<td>使用效果的粗估</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二级点击归因</td>\n<td>引导后点击了结果</td>\n<td>入口标记 + 结果点击</td>\n<td>引导是否有效</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增量归因</td>\n<td>相对反事实的差异</td>\n<td>AB 实验 / 反事实估计</td>\n<td>真实价值</td>\n<td>无（但需实验）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>二级点击归因</strong>是一个实用的中间口径，值得单独说明：引导词执行后，用户是否<strong>点击了搜索结果</strong>。它过滤掉了「点了引导词但结果不满意立刻返回」的情况，因而比纯点击归因更接近「这次引导有用」。但它仍然不是增量的——用户可能本来就打算搜这个。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据契约-埋点要先于功能\">数据契约：埋点要先于功能</h2><p>归因的可行性完全取决于埋点，而埋点必须在功能上线的<strong>同时</strong>存在，不能事后补。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四个必须记录的字段\">四个必须记录的字段</h3><p><strong>入口来源</strong>：这次搜索是从输入框来的、从引导位来的、还是从筛选器来的。没有这个字段，后续所有归因都无法开始。</p>\n<p><strong>曝光标识</strong>：推荐位第几次曝光（同一页面可能多次刷新）、以及每条候选在列表里的位置。位置字段不只是为了分析位置效应，它还是纠偏的前提。</p>\n<p><strong>列表快照</strong>：本次展示的全部候选（或其指纹）。它让「用户点的那一条当时排在什么位置」这个问题可回答。</p>\n<p><strong>决策依据</strong>：这次列表是个性化过的吗、有没有被商业加权改变位次、护栏有没有拦掉候选。最后一项的重要性容易被低估：<strong>没有它，归因报表无法回答「加权引导的效果是否真的更好」这个直接影响第二章第 3 篇参数决策的问题</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"会话串联的键\">会话串联的键</h3><p>四个字段之间需要一个能把它们串起来的键。可选的有三种：<code>exposure_id</code>（每次推荐位曝光一个唯一 id）、<code>session_id</code>（会话级）、以及 <code>subject_id</code>（用户级）。<strong>应当以 <code>exposure_id</code> 为主键</strong>，因为一次会话内可能有多次曝光（刷新、翻页），用会话级会把这几次曝光的效果混在一起，无法归因到具体的列表。</p>\n<p>而 <code>subject_id</code> 只在「引导后是否存在转化」这一步需要——因为转化可能发生在引导之后的任何一次会话里，只有用户级标识能把它关联回来。这三者的关系是一次典型的漏斗连接：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 引导会话串联（一次查询 -&gt; 引导点击 -&gt; 后续转化）&#10;WITH exposure AS (&#10;  SELECT&#10;    e.exposure_id, e.query_norm AS src_query, e.session_id, e.subject_id,&#10;    e.placement, e.dt,&#10;    e.used_personalization, e.commercial_weighted, e.items_shown&#10;  FROM related_search_exposure e&#10;  WHERE e.dt = :dt&#10;),&#10;guided_click AS (&#10;  SELECT&#10;    c.exposure_id, c.related_query, c.position,&#10;    c.clicked_at, c.related_search_id          -- 引导词的这次检索 id&#10;  FROM related_search_click c&#10;),&#10;downstream AS (&#10;  SELECT&#10;    g.exposure_id,&#10;    g.related_query,&#10;    g.position,&#10;    -- 引导后的二级点击：引导词这次检索里有结果点击&#10;    COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE r.search_id = g.related_search_id&#10;                       AND r.clicked_item_id IS NOT NULL) &gt; 0 AS had_result_click,&#10;    -- 引导后 30 分钟内的成交&#10;    COUNT(DISTINCT o.order_id) AS orders,&#10;    SUM(o.gmv)                 AS gmv_norm&#10;  FROM guided_click g&#10;  LEFT JOIN search_result_exposure r ON r.search_id = g.related_search_id&#10;  LEFT JOIN orders o&#10;         ON o.subject_id = (SELECT subject_id FROM exposure WHERE exposure_id = g.exposure_id)&#10;        AND o.order_ts &gt; g.clicked_at&#10;        AND o.order_ts &lt; g.clicked_at + INTERVAL &#39;30 minutes&#39;&#10;  GROUP BY 1, 2, 3&#10;)&#10;SELECT&#10;  e.placement,&#10;  e.used_personalization,&#10;  e.commercial_weighted,&#10;  COUNT(DISTINCT e.exposure_id)                                    AS exposures,&#10;  COUNT(DISTINCT g.exposure_id)                                    AS guided_clicks,&#10;  COUNT(DISTINCT g.exposure_id) FILTER (WHERE d.had_result_click)  AS effective_clicks,&#10;  SUM(d.orders)                                                    AS orders,&#10;  SUM(d.gmv_norm)                                                  AS gmv_norm&#10;FROM exposure e&#10;LEFT JOIN guided_click g USING (exposure_id)&#10;LEFT JOIN downstream d USING (exposure_id, related_query, position)&#10;GROUP BY 1, 2, 3;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 引导会话串联（一次查询 -> 引导点击 -> 后续转化）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> exposure </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">exposure_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">query_norm</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> src_query, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">session_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">subject_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">placement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">used_personalization</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">commercial_weighted</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">items_shown</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> related_search_exposure e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :dt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">guided_click </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">exposure_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">related_query</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">position</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">clicked_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">related_search_id</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          -- 引导词的这次检索 id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> related_search_click c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">downstream </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">exposure_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">related_query</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">position</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    -- 引导后的二级点击：引导词这次检索里有结果点击</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">search_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">related_search_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                       AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">clicked_item_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> had_result_click,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    -- 引导后 30 分钟内的成交</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gmv</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gmv_norm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> guided_click g</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> search_result_exposure r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">search_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">related_search_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">subject_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> subject_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> exposure </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> exposure_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">exposure_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_ts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">clicked_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_ts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">clicked_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'30 minutes'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0